WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Good morning, and welcome back to the daily English podcast.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.900
Today we are going to talk about habits, and why small ones matter.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.600
A habit is a decision you only have to make once.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.400
After that, the routine carries you, even on the days you feel lazy.

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.000
So start small, stay consistent, and let the system do the remembering.
